# Ganyu Mavuika Xiangling Escoffier. ~20s Rot. On-field Melt Ganyu. Ganyu does 2 Es per rotation. mavuika feeds particles to Xiangling, who bursts every rotation. Mavuika and Escoffier burst every other in alternate rotations; Mavuika's burst is melted. Not heavily optimized.

# Team - Options Listed by DPS
ganyu char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
ganyu add weapon="crescent" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#ganyu add weapon="scion" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
